    "unit": 46,
    "title": "Reported Speech with Modal Verbs",
    "title_ko": "조동사가 포함된 간접화법",
    "focus_axis": "grammar"
  },
  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Modal verbs shift in reported speech: 'will' → 'would', 'can' → 'could', 'may' → 'might'. But 'should', 'would', 'could', and 'might' usually stay the same: 'I can help' → 'She said she could help.' 'You should rest' → 'He said I should rest.'",
    "explanation_ko": "조동사는 간접화법에서 형태가 바뀝니다: 'will' → 'would', 'can' → 'could', 'may' → 'might'. 하지만 'should', 'would', 'could', 'might'는 보통 그대로입니다: 'I can help' → 'She said she could help.' 'You should rest' → 'He said I should rest.'",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "She said she would be late.",
        "ko": "그녀는 늦을 거라고 말했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "He said he could finish it by Friday.",
        "ko": "그는 금요일까지 끝낼 수 있다고 말했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "They said it might rain later.",
        "ko": "그들은 나중에 비가 올지도 모른다고 말했어요."
      }
    ]
  },
  "tasks": [
