      "skill": "writing",
      "task_type": "situation_response",
      "prompt": {
        "en": "A friend told you: 'I can help you move this weekend.' Write what your friend said, using reported speech with the shifted modal.",
        "ko": "친구가 'I can help you move this weekend.'라고 말했습니다. 조동사가 변화된 간접화법으로 써 보세요."
      },
